cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the archived results, please cite it as below."
title: "FlyWord: dopamine-gated plasticity in a FlyWire mushroom-body subcircuit"
abstract: >-
  A Brian2 model of a real FlyWire (release 783) olfactory subcircuit
  (ALPN -> Kenyon cell -> MBON with DAN reinforcement). The work reports a
  diagnostic recode of the ALPN -> Kenyon-cell transform, which restores a
  decodable Kenyon-cell category code but does not restore the online
  MBON-argmax readout, and growth-matched controls showing that structural
  growth is a decoder-capacity effect rather than a learned prototype.
authors:
  - family-names: "Giavedoni"
    given-names: "Nicolas"
date-released: "2026-10-19"
license: MIT
